questions.analysis:
因 $\omega L = \frac{1}{\omega C} = R$，故
$$
\begin{aligned}
\widetilde{Z}_{R} &= R, \quad \widetilde{Z}_{L} = j\omega L = jR \\
\widetilde{Z}_{C} &= \frac{1}{j\omega C} = -jR
\end{aligned}
$$

![](data/images/9445256c/物理学难题集萃上册-586.jpg)

网络各支路中的复电流标示如电图5.8.1所示，则有
$$
\left\{
\begin{aligned}
AY: & \quad \widetilde{I}_{1}(1+j)R = (\widetilde{I} - \widetilde{I}_{1})(-jR) + \widetilde{I}_{2}R \\
XB: & \quad \widetilde{I}_{2}R + (\widetilde{I}_{1} + \widetilde{I}_{2})(-jR) = (\widetilde{I} - \widetilde{I}_{1} - \widetilde{I}_{2})(1+j)R
\end{aligned}
\right.
$$

即
$$
\left\{
\begin{aligned}
\widetilde{I}_{2} &= \widetilde{I}_{1} + \widetilde{I}j \\
2\widetilde{I}_{2} &= \widetilde{I}(1+j) - \widetilde{I}_{1}
\end{aligned}
\right.
$$

解出
$$
\left\{
\begin{aligned}
\widetilde{I}_{1} &= \frac{1}{3}(1-j)\widetilde{I} \\
\widetilde{I}_{2} &= \frac{1}{3}(1+2j)\widetilde{I}
\end{aligned}
\right.
$$

设 $A$ 和 $B$ 之间总的复阻抗为 $\widetilde{Z}_{AB}$，则有
$$
\begin{aligned}
\widetilde{U}_{AB} &= \widetilde{I}\widetilde{Z}_{AB} = \widetilde{I}_{1}(1+j)R + (\widetilde{I}_{1} + \widetilde{I}_{2})(-jR) = \widetilde{I}_{1}R - \widetilde{I}_{2}jR \\
&= \frac{1}{3}(1-j)\widetilde{I}R - \frac{1}{3}(1+2j)\widetilde{I}jR = \frac{1}{3}(3-2j)\widetilde{I}R
\end{aligned}
$$

故
$$
\widetilde{Z}_{AB} = \frac{1}{3}(3-2j)R \quad \text{或写成} \quad \widetilde{Z}_{AB} = Z_{AB}\mathrm{e}^{j\varphi_{Z}}
$$

其中
$$
Z_{AB} = \frac{\sqrt{13}}{3}R = 1.20R, \quad \tan\varphi_{z} = -\frac{2}{3}
$$

总电流为
$$
\widetilde{I} = \frac{\widetilde{U}}{\widetilde{Z}_{AB}} = \frac{U_{0}\mathrm{e}^{j(\omega t + \varphi_{u})}}{Z_{AB}\mathrm{e}^{j\varphi_{Z}}}
$$

所求 $X$ 和 $Y$ 两点之间的电流为
$$
\begin{aligned}
\widetilde{I}_{2} &= \frac{1}{3}(1+2j)\widetilde{I} = \frac{1}{3}(1+2j)\frac{U_{0}\mathrm{e}^{j(\omega t + \varphi_{u})}}{\frac{1}{3}(3-2j)R} = \frac{(1+2j)U_{0}}{(3-2j)R}\mathrm{e}^{j(\omega t + \varphi_{u})} \\
&= \frac{(-1+8j)U_{0}}{13R}\mathrm{e}^{j(\omega t + \varphi_{u})} = \left(\frac{\sqrt{65}}{13}\mathrm{e}^{j\varphi_{i_{2}}}\right)\frac{U_{0}}{R}\mathrm{e}^{j(\omega t + \varphi_{u})}
\end{aligned}
$$

故 $\tilde{I}_{2}$ 的有效值为
$$
I_{2} = \frac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \cdot \frac{\sqrt{65}}{13}\frac{U_{0}}{R} = \sqrt{\frac{5}{26}}\frac{U_{0}}{R} = 0.44\frac{U_{0}}{R}
$$

